      <title>Half-Life 3 或隨 Steam Machine 推出　傳 2026 年春季登場成首發遊戲</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2025/12/14/half-life-3-steam-machine-launch-rumor/game-channel/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=half-life-3-steam-machine-launch-rumor</link>
      <description>Valve 開發多年的《Half-Life 3》終於有望與玩家見面。據業內人士透露，這款備受期待續作將作為 Steam Machine 主機首發遊戲，預計 2026 年春季推出，惟記憶體價格急升令發布計劃出現變數。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2025/12/14/half-life-3-steam-machine-launch-rumor/game-channel/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=half-life-3-steam-machine-launch-rumor</guid>
